Subject: [PATCH 1/3] libstore, nix-store: verify CACTEE attestation certificates

Base:   NixOS/nix 0765ffa540e2adfda7b69efafdbac821ebc48034
        (master, 2026-09-04, "Merge pull request #16340 from JamieMagee/fuzz/seed-replay")
Source: nix-tee/nix-fork/nix-src (branch feature/tee-attestation)

Adds client-side CACTEE certificate verification to libstore: substituted
and copied store paths are rejected unless their {hashPart}.attestation.json
CACTEE certificate verifies against attestation-cactee-manifest. Adds serve protocol
2.9 (PutAttestation), nix-store --import-nar, the attestation-* settings,
and the certificate verifier that libstore compiles in. The default
substituters list becomes empty.

Apply with: git apply <patch>   or   patch -p1 < <patch>

Apply from the root of a NixOS/nix checkout at the base commit.
See README.md next to this file for the file list and caveats.
